{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……快要２个月了。”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4926", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟新吾交往后就感觉时间过得好快。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一转眼就２个月。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是对我来说每天都很新鲜。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是我还没有表现得像一个合格的恋人。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君今天请假呢。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6616", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，感冒了。昨天傍晚就开始发烧，还咳嗽咳个不停。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7119", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天早上好像恢复不少了，不过以防万一还是请假在家休息。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7120", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊……他总是在寒风中很努力呢。”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6617", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4928", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "社团活动中，新吾总是担下室外的工作。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大多是力气活，他是不想让我们女孩子感冒吧。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是勉强自己的后果就是得了感冒，那家伙真是……", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你担心瓜生君？”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6618", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然啦。那个人只要不管他立刻就会逞强，就算自己不舒服也只会体贴周围的人……”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4929", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼嗯，你很了解男朋友呢。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6619", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你想调侃我？”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4930", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是的。只是纱凪意外地冷静，让我有点惊讶而已。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6620", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我以为以你的个性，知道瓜生君感冒……”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6954", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“会慌张又手足无措，担心过头甚至引起骚动之类的。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6955", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7121", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“甚至说今天自己也要请假，陪在他身边照顾他……”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6956", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理太天真了。”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7122", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？为、为什么啊？”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6957", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“昨天傍晚他感冒恶化联络我的时候，我已经闹过一阵，而且立刻就突击新吾的房间了。”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7123", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“果、果然是这样。纱凪的话当然会那么做呢……”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6958", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那昨天去探病稍微安心下来，所以今天就自己来上学了？”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6959", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是，就像爱理刚才说的，我本来也想今天请假陪在他身边照顾他……”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7124", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……原来如此，瓜生君不让你这么做啊。”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6960", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……他说很高兴我的心意，但是不能让我因为他请假……”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7125", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天早上去了他家后他已经好多了，恢复活力后……很明确地这样对我说。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算感冒，瓜生君还是那个瓜生君呢。”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6961", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就是说啊。这就是新吾呢，所以我也接受了。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是……", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理果然太天真了。”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7126", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，我又说错了什么？”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6962", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是……那个啦，可以稍微放闪一下吗？”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7127", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……看你的表情，我好像也不能不听吧……唉。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6963", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然有不好的预感，但你说吧。”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6623", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀～就是啊！因为感冒变虚弱的新吾实在好可爱好可爱好可爱，可爱到我都想吃掉他了！”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4934", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道说这些话很坏，可是会想为他做所有的事情啊，那家伙总是很可靠的样子对吧？”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4935", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以这种时候才会更想对他好啊，一摸摸他的头他就眼神迷蒙，真的是、真的是！”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4936", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6624", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉，我太得意忘形了。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4937", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道自己很烦人，可是就是想跟谁说。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想要有人听我聊新吾。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉纱凪去了好远的地方。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6625", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4938", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉变成跟我不一样的女孩子了。虽然我想是瓜生君让你这样的啦……”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6626", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理不交男朋友吗？”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4939", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“开玩笑。我没办法依存男人到那种程度。”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6627", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我害怕那样。”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6628", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明只要爱理愿意，想跟她交往的男人要多少就有多少。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过我也知道，她不会喜欢那种类型的男孩子。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……能让爱理爱上的男人，是什么样的呢？", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我很感兴趣。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且，我现在已经被纱凪的放闪撑饱了。”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6629", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“交往后对对方都没有不满吗？瓜生君有这么完美啊……”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6630", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛……也不知道算不算完美……”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4940", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不满……也不是没有……嗯。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想要他多忌妒一点、接吻太厉害、笑容太温柔、抱着我的手太可靠之类的。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7128", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉如果我说这是不满，爱理真的会生气。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我自己也觉得刚才那些不是不满，只是单纯放闪……", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也就是说，我对新吾完全没有不满？", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是新吾也不是完美的男朋友吧……", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸～瓜生君是草食系的吧～”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 396, "voice": "_jz0022", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也觉得耶。呐呐纱凪，那方面怎么样？”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "结女学生F", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "_jx0009", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？你们在说什么？”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4941", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然被抛了话题过来，我看了爱理一眼。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这几个人是喜欢讨论女性杂志上敏感话题的小团体。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "之前她们讨论的“不想跟这种女生交往排行榜”我到现在还有心理阴影。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“杂志上有草食系情侣的话题喔。”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 396, "voice": "_jz0023", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君果然是草食系的吧？”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 396, "voice": "_jz0024", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我有听说过。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "近年来，这种不会积极追求女生，跟异性只是友好关系的温和男生变多了。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与之相反的就是肉食系。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不恋爱就活不下去的女孩子也是算肉食系的。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生君真的给人一种待在一起就能安心的感觉呢。”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "结女学生F", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "_jx0010", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这、这个嘛……嗯……”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7129", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么一说他的确没有对我强势过……所以是吧。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾总是很温柔……不对，他有的时候也很坏心眼……", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过那也是为接下来的温柔甜蜜做准备……结果还是不算坏心眼。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……啊，刚才就一直觉得不对劲的地方，问题就出在这里啊。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟他在一起非常、非～～～常令人安心。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是也会希望他强势一点，应该说他几乎不积极，有时候让人不满足……", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是啊，不被男人索求的话，身为女人会觉得心情有点复杂不是吗？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "结女学生E", "alt_speaker_idx": 396, "voice": "_jz0025", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～的确会那样呢。在房间里两人独处气氛正好的时候，如果对方平平淡淡的……”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "结女学生F", "alt_speaker_idx": 397, "voice": "_jx0011", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4943", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我越听越觉得新吾一定是草食系。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "基本上都是我主动索吻，两个人相处的时候也是我单方面陶醉。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还有……最重要的一件事实。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然因为接吻让我太满足所以就忽略了……", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──在平安夜的初体验之后，他一次都没有索求过我的身体！", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不只如此，新吾甚至没有做过任何色色的事情。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不久前，勾手时胸部碰到手臂也是……回想起来，新吾好像有意尽快结束话题！", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这、这、这表示、该不会──", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱……爱理怎么办！我！”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7130", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？等、什么、纱凪……！？”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6964", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我把爱理拉到走廊上。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后一股脑把烦恼倾诉出来。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我有不满！超级有！怎么办爱理！？我、新吾没有对我索求身体……！”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7131", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪！？你、你冷静一点！”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6965", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我怎么冷静得──唔唔！”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7132", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要在走廊上大喊那种事情。”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6966", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7133", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "见我点头，爱理这才放开捂住我嘴巴的手。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后她双手叉在同性看了都会羡慕的纤腰上，叹了一口气。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，呃，嗯，我明白你的意思了。”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6967", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔喔！不愧是爱理，理解得这么快太好了……那、那我该怎么办……”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7134", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不怎么办，那种事……不对，虽然我不太清楚，但那没什么好奇怪的，应该说很普通不是吗？”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6968", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“又不是所有男性都以女性的身体为目标，而且是瓜生君的话更能理解，能安心信赖──”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6969", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一点也部普通！一点也不能安心！”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7135", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果从交往开始就一直是柏拉图式恋爱，那我也不是不能懂爱理说的话……", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是我们不是那样！我们已经有经验了！在去年的平安夜！", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾那个时候明明对我着迷得让我好一段时间都动不了……明明那么勇猛……", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从那之后到现在大概２个月的期间，他却完全没有表现出那一面──", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“冷静一想……新吾是不是注意到了？我完全没有身为女人的魅力……”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7136", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，是胸部吗？是胸部吧，B罩杯对新吾来说不够吧……唔啊啊！”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "sn7137", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，如果说胸部，那我也没资格说什么……跟纱凪没差多少……”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6970", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我、我得想想办法……不然就糟了！", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪？你有在听吗？”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6971", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且新吾的确是草食系的，这样下去……初体验就要变成最终体验了……", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不要！我不要那样！身为女人果然是想要被喜欢的人索求啊……", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就因为对方是很温柔的新吾，所以我希望他能想要我，就算不强势也没关系。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "既然如此！", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那、那个……纱凪？”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "ar6972", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理，我决定了！”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4948", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“决定什么？”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6634", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天起，我要成为肉食系女子！！”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "_sn4949", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、欸欸！？”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 389, "voice": "_ar6635", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
